{"type":"message","id":"a3dc5432","parentId":"faf12d53","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:44:11.260Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 02:44 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为查事小弟，用playwright工具访问以下三个网站，分析页面结构，提取公告/通知栏目的正确CSS选择器：\n1. 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局：http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\n2. 厦门科学技术局：http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\n3. 厦门市软件行业协会：http://www.xmsia.cn/Pages/Home/NewsList.aspx?classId=3\n需要找到的选择器：\n- 列表容器选择器（包含所有公告条目的父元素）\n- 单个条目选择器（每一条公告的元素）\n- 标题选择器（每个公告的标题文本元素）\n- 链接选择器（每个公告的跳转链接元素）\n- 日期选择器（每个公告的发布日期元素）\n返回每个站点的选择器测试结果，确保能正确提取到最新的公告信息。"}],"timestamp":1773427451259}}
{"type":"message","id":"eebac99f","parentId":"a3dc5432","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:44:20.805Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, I need to complete this subagent task where I use Playwright to access three Xiamen government and association websites, extract CSS selectors for their announcement sections. First, I should create a Playwright script to do this, right?\n\nWait, first let me check if Playwright is installed? No, maybe I can just write a Node.js script that uses Playwright to visit each site, analyze the selectors, test them, and output the results. Then run it with exec.\n\nWait let's plan:\n1. First write a playwright script that does the following for each URL:\n   - Launch browser, go to the page\n   - Find the list container, items, title, link, date elements\n   - Test the selectors by extracting a few items to verify they work\n   - Collect all the selectors\n2. Run the script, get the results, then return them.\n\nSo first step: create the script file. Let's name it extract-selectors.js.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_vi4pnsg2ysin5yyje7iypfnh","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/extract-selectors.js","content":"const { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\nconst sites = [\n  {\n    name: \"厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\",\n    url: \"http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\"\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"厦门科学技术局\",\n    url: \"http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\"\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"厦门市软件行业协会\",\n    url: \"http://www.xmsia.cn/Pages/Home/NewsList.aspx?classId=3\"\n  }\n];\n\nasync function extractSelectors(site) {\n  console.log(`\\n===== 正在处理: ${site.name} =====`);\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  await page.goto(site.url, { waitUntil: 'networkidle', timeout: 30000 });\n\n  let selectors = {};\n  let testResults = [];\n\n  switch(site.name) {\n    case \"厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\":\n      selectors = {\n        listContainer: \".newsList\",\n        listItem: \".newsList li\",\n        title: \"a\",\n        link: \"a\",\n        date: \"span\"\n      };\n      break;\n    case \"厦门科学技术局\":\n      selectors = {\n        listContainer: \".list-box ul\",\n        listItem: \".list-box ul li\",\n        title: \"a\",\n        link: \"a\",\n        date: \"span\"\n      };\n      break;\n    case \"厦门市软件行业协会\":\n      selectors = {\n        listContainer: \"#listcontent\",\n        listItem: \"#listcontent li\",\n        title: \"a\",\n        link: \"a\",\n        date: \"span.time\"\n      };\n      break;\n  }\n\n  // 测试选择器\n  try {\n    const items = await page.locator(selectors.listItem).all();\n    console.log(`找到 ${items.length} 条公告`);\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(3, items.length); i++) {\n      const item = items[i];\n      const title = await item.locator(selectors.title).first().textContent();\n      const link = await item.locator(selectors.link).first().getAttribute('href');\n      const date = await item.locator(selectors.date).first().textContent();\n      \n      testResults.push({\n        title: title?.trim(),\n        link: link?.trim(),\n        date: date?.trim()\n      });\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.error(`选择器测试失败: ${e.message}`);\n  }\n\n  await browser.close();\n\n  return {\n    site: site.name,\n    url: site.url,\n    selectors,\n    testResults\n  };\n}\n\n(async () => {\n  const results = [];\n  for (const site of sites) {\n    const result = await extractSelectors(site);\n    results.push(result);\n  }\n\n  console.log(\"\\n\\n===== 最终结果 =====\");\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(results, null, 2));\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773427451260}}
