{"type":"message","id":"22ea5d11","parentId":"ff383212","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:44:58.250Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_k4m10049vfec0e0opeeoicok","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning: background execution is disabled; running synchronously.\n\n===== 调试: 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局 =====\n页面前5000字符:\n<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><script async=\"\" src=\"https://wbp.terton.com.cn/webapi/auth/check.jhtml?callback=wzaJsonpCallBack&amp;sn=1746762301962826&amp;_=1773427496670\"></script><avalon ms-skip=\"1\" class=\"avalonHide\"><style id=\"avalonStyle\">.avalonHide{ display: none!important }</style><a class=\"prev\" ms-if=\"pageIndex&gt;1\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\" ms-click=\"toPage(pageIndex-1,$event)\"><em></em>上一页</a><a class=\"next nextStop\" ms-if=\"pageIndex==pageCount\">下一页<em></em></a></avalon><avalon ms-skip=\"1\" class=\"avalonHide\"><style id=\"avalonStyle\">.avalonHide{ display: none!important }</style></avalon>\n\t\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\" name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0\">\n\t\t<meta name=\"SiteName\" content=\"厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\">\n<meta name=\"SiteDomain\" content=\"hrss.xm.gov.cn\">\n<meta name=\"SiteCode\" content=\"3502000012\">\n\t\t<meta name=\"ColumnName\" content=\"通知公告\">\n<meta name=\"ColumnDescription\" content=\"通知公告主要用于通知公告等信息的发布\">\n<meta name=\"ColumnKeywords\" content=\"厦门市人力资源和社会保障局,通知公告\">\n<meta name=\"ColumnType\" content=\"通知公告\">\n\t\t<title>通知公告-厦门市人力资源和社会保障局</title>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/col_ul_style.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/head_foot_style.css\" ignoreapd=\"\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/21rsj.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/current.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/21rsj_media.css\">\n\t<style type=\"text/css\">.ui-dialog {\n    *zoom:1;\n    _float: left;\n    position: 